    "updated_at": "2015-09-21T17:48:23Z",
    "body": "It looks like https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-label-element:the-label-element-10 gives actual normative behavior changes based on the content model, not just authoring conformance criteria. So this is a real issue. If you dig into the Mozilla bug you can see where it led.\n",
