    "created_at": "2015-10-29T14:11:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-29T14:11:58Z",
    "body": "Great! It's not clear that we have come to an agreement about what the spec should say, though.\n\nPossibly we could do the simple fix here that addresses the implementation problem, i.e. `a` without `href` is not interactive content, but `a` does not allow `a` descendants in its content model, and file a new issue about separating content model from UA requirements and possibly then changing back the content model rule after that. WDYT @annevk @domenic ?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
